                                "sense_id": "2b93b96b-83d4-30b9-bd8d-e4f90b1252bc",
                                "text": "This was the Pegomancy of the Greeks; who also solicited the answer of the Nymphs of the Spring, by offerings of bread, stones, or coins, or by dipping in a mirror, and construing the figures which the water had left on it."
